{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","id":"pg_a95707664e975cf8a26071d5e0af88a1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aeonfun-aeon-docs-core-md-95142d19705c-71d5e0af88a1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_de11506c52b55f128536633353876a05"],"title":"aeonfun/aeon/docs/CORE.md @ 95142d19705c","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_05238a9ba3ab42a8c795857dfa72d7ef826a7efc4448d82d0c2dad2dc57c7869"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The capabilities field is documentation only, not a gate: unknown values are rejected at install, but any allow-listed combination installs and nothing enforces the declared capabilities at runtime."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5f001f6525c45d78b17de8657799f68ad39f813c06aa0aaee070352d0a4218e2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"If no OS sandbox is available, run-harness warns that read-only is advisory on stderr and only the tool-allowlist and post-run layers apply; CI installs bubblewrap explicitly to avoid silent downgrade."},{"claim_ids":["clm_958577e6bdd5a79ee293e4b5ac5a4b97ce478b15ed4400cb55691640eb4c6879"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The one runtime-enforced axis is the SKILL.md mode tier: read-only mode strips write tools, mounts the repo read-only via an OS sandbox (bwrap on Linux, sandbox-exec on macOS) across all nine harnesses, and a post-run guard reverts stray writes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f6fc7f6df588f8bc53d7c4170a8ab700d8eac9ddbb51ffb0996592c12c5f6268"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: adding a new capability value requires one PR updating the taxonomy doc, the schema reference, and the install-skill-pack allow-list constant, enforced by a ci-capabilities-parity workflow that fails when the three disagree."}],"claim_ids":["clm_05238a9ba3ab42a8c795857dfa72d7ef826a7efc4448d82d0c2dad2dc57c7869","clm_5f001f6525c45d78b17de8657799f68ad39f813c06aa0aaee070352d0a4218e2","clm_958577e6bdd5a79ee293e4b5ac5a4b97ce478b15ed4400cb55691640eb4c6879","clm_f6fc7f6df588f8bc53d7c4170a8ab700d8eac9ddbb51ffb0996592c12c5f6268"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","id":"pg_b69f0084c49b5df3a13055fc84becbd3","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aeonfun-aeon-docs-capabilities-md-95142d19705c-55fc84becbd3.md","rec